## 2. Schéma Relationnel de la Base de Données  

### Entités principales  

| Table | PK | FK | Colonnes majeures | Relations |
|-------|----|----|-------------------|-----------|
| `companies` | `id` (UUID) | – | `name`, `address`, `created_at` | 1‑N → `warehouses` |
| `warehouses` | `id` (UUID) | `company_id` (FK) | `name`, `location (geography)`, `capacity` | 1‑N → `stock_items` ; 1‑N → `zones` |
| `zones` | `id` (UUID) | `warehouse_id` (FK) | `code`, `description` | 1‑N → `stock_items` |
| `stock_items` | `id` (UUID) | `warehouse_id` (FK), `zone_id` (FK) | `sku`, `product_name`, `quantity`, `reorder_point` | N‑N via `stock_item_batches` |
| `stock_item_batches` | `id` (UUID) | `stock_item_id` (FK) | `batch_number`, `expiry_date`, `quantity` | – |
| `suppliers` | `id` (UUID) | – | `name`, `contact_info` | 1‑N → `purchase_orders` |
| `purchase_orders` | `id` (UUID) | `supplier_id` (FK), `warehouse_id` (FK) | `order_number`, `status`, `created_at` | 1‑N → `purchase_order_lines` |
| `purchase_order_lines` | `id` (UUID) | `purchase_order_id` (FK), `stock_item_id` (FK) | `quantity`, `unit_price` | – |
| `customers` | `id` (UUID) | – | `name`, `email`, `address` | 1‑N → `sales_orders` |
| `sales_orders` | `id` (UUID) | `customer_id` (FK), `warehouse_id` (FK) | `order_number`, `status`, `created_at` | 1‑N → `sales_order_lines` |
| `sales_order_lines` | `id` (UUID) | `sales_order_id` (FK), `stock_item_id` (FK) | `quantity`, `unit_price` | – |
| `shipments` | `id` (UUID) | `sales_order_id` (FK) | `tracking_number`, `status`, `departure_at`, `arrival_estimated` | 1‑N → `shipment_items` |
| `shipment_items` | `id` (UUID) | `shipment_id` (FK), `stock_item_id` (FK) | `quantity` | – |
| `trucks` | `id` (UUID) | – | `license_plate`, `model`, `capacity` | 1‑N → `truck_locations` |
| `truck_locations` | `id` (UUID) | `truck_id` (FK) | `timestamp`, `position (geography)` | – |
| `users` | `id` (UUID) | `company_id` (FK) | `username`, `email`, `hashed_password`, `role` | – |
| `roles` | `id` (UUID) | – | `name`, `permissions (jsonb)` | – |
| `audit_logs` | `id` (UUID) | `user_id` (FK) | `action`, `entity`, `entity_id`, `timestamp`, `details (jsonb)` | – |
| `integration_tokens` | `id` (UUID) | `company_id` (FK) | `token`, `expires_at`, `scopes (jsonb)` | – |

### Relations clés  

- `companies.id` 1‑N `warehouses.company_id`  
- `warehouses.id` 1‑N `zones.warehouse_id`  
- `warehouses.id` 1‑N `stock_items.warehouse_id`  
- `zones.id` 1‑N `stock_items.zone_id`  
- `stock_items.id` 1‑N `stock_item_batches.stock_item_id`  
- `suppliers.id` 1‑N `purchase_orders.supplier_id`  
- `purchase_orders.id` 1‑N `purchase_order_lines.purchase_order_id`  
- `purchase_order_lines.stock_item_id` N‑1 `stock_items.id`  
- `customers.id` 1‑N `sales_orders.customer_id`  
- `sales_orders.id` 1‑N `sales_order_lines.sales_order_id`  
- `sales_order_lines.stock_item_id` N‑1 `stock_items.id`  
- `sales_orders.id` 1‑N `shipments.sales_order_id`  
- `shipments.id` 1‑N `shipment_items.shipment_id`  
- `shipment_items.stock_item_id` N‑1 `stock_items.id`  
- `trucks.id` 1‑N `truck_locations.truck_id`  

